<title>USA: PEFCO sells $125 mln in seven-year secured notes.</title>
<headline>PEFCO sells $125 mln in seven-year secured notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from</p>
<p>Private Export Funding Corp (PEFCO) was priced on Tuesday,</p>
<p>according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER PRIVATE EXPORT FUNDING CORP</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 7.01 PCT   MATURITY 4/30/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SECURED NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 10/30/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AAA   YIELD 7.01 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AAA	 SPREAD +17 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
